    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried that. i went into my room and turned everything off, but i can still hear my own heart beating and my own thoughts. it's never actually quiet. it's like no matter what i do, there's always some kind of static or pressure. i just want a real kind of silence. like, nothingness. something that doesn't just go away when i open my eyes.",
