    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "breathing doesn't do anything. it feels like a temporary fix for a permanent problem. i'm just so tired of existing in this constant loop of noise and light and feeling everything so intensely. it's exhausting to be alive. i feel like i'm just waiting for a way to finally turn it all off for good, you know? like i just want to find that real silence that isn't just a pause.",
